<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-160.3-assignment-administration-tax-payroll-repatriation-and-analytics" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W4713" name="W4713. Assignment Payroll, Multi-Currency &amp; Home/Host Split-Pay Operations" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Assignment start; payroll cycle; mid-assignment change
Frequency: Per pay cycle (semi-monthly)
Volume: ~10–20 active assignees on multi-currency/split pay
Owner: Mobility Payroll Manager / Payroll (VS-19.2)
Participants: Payroll (VS-19.2), Treasury/FX (VS-18.3), Comp (VS-102), Tax (VS-79), assignment-payroll vendor (W4700)
Source: workflow W4713 — Assignment Payroll, Multi-Currency &amp; Home/Host Split-Pay Operations</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4713_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4713_Lane1" name="Mobility Payroll">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4713_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4713_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4713_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4713_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4713_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4713_Start3" name="Assignment start; payroll cycle; mid-assignment change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4713_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4713_Task4" name="Set up the assignment pay structure: home-country pay vs. host-country pay…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Set up the assignment pay structure: home-country pay vs. host-country pay split (per the package W4699), multi-currency, and the home/host entity payroll feeds (VS-72); configure in payroll (VS-19.2) and the assignment-payroll vendor
Responsible (R): Mobility Payroll / Payroll / Treasury
Accountable (A): Head of Global Mobility / CFO
Duration: Per assignment</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4713_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4713_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4713_Task5" name="Run assignment payroll each cycle: home and host components, FX conversion…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Run assignment payroll each cycle: home and host components, FX conversion (VS-18.3), allowances (premium, COLA, hardship), and tax/equalization entries (W4714); reconcile split-pay across entities
Responsible (R): Mobility Payroll / Payroll
Accountable (A): Head of Global Mobility / CFO
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4713_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4713_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4713_Task6" name="Manage mid-assignment changes (package, currency, entity), year-end…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Manage mid-assignment changes (package, currency, entity), year-end reconciliation, and hand-off to repatriation/localization payroll (W4718); ensure SoD and audit trail
Responsible (R): Mobility Payroll / Payroll
Accountable (A): Head of Global Mobility / CFO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4713_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4713_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4713_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4713_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-712 (ensure controlled execution — Assignment Administration, Tax/Payroll, Repatriation &amp; Analytics (PA-160.3).) | - CTL-712: split-pay per package; FX from governed source (VS-18.3); reconciled across entities; SoD
Owner: Mobility Payroll Manager / Payroll (VS-19.2)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4713_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4713_Annotation8" targetRef="W4713_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4713_Flow10" sourceRef="W4713_Start3" targetRef="W4713_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4713_Flow11" sourceRef="W4713_Task4" targetRef="W4713_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4713_Flow12" sourceRef="W4713_Task5" targetRef="W4713_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4713_Flow13" sourceRef="W4713_Task6" targetRef="W4713_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
