    <bpmn:process id="W_W4716" name="W4716. Assignment Housing, Relocation &amp; Settling-In Administration" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Assignment start (with relocation)
Frequency: Per assignment
Volume: ~10–15 LT assignments with housing/relocation
Owner: Relocation Manager / Employee Accommodation (VS-144)
Participants: Accommodation (VS-144), relocation vendor (W4700), OH (VS-83), HR (VS-19)
Source: workflow W4716 — Assignment Housing, Relocation &amp; Settling-In Administration</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4716_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4716_Lane1" name="Relocation">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4716_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4716_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4716_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4716_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4716_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4716_Start3" name="Assignment start (with relocation)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4716_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4716_Task4" name="Arrange assignment housing (company-leased vs. allowance, per package W4699…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Arrange assignment housing (company-leased vs. allowance, per package W4699; links to VS-144 staff accommodation for options), relocation (moving, storage), and settling-in services
Responsible (R): Relocation / Accommodation
Accountable (A): Head of Global Mobility
Duration: Per assignment</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4716_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4716_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4716_Task5" name="Support settling-in: local registration, banking, healthcare enrollment…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Support settling-in: local registration, banking, healthcare enrollment (VS-83), schooling (dependents W4710), and community/spousal-support info; manage the housing lifecycle (lease, maintenance, exit)
Responsible (R): Relocation / OH / Accommodation
Accountable (A): Head of Global Mobility
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4716_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4716_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4716_Task6" name="Manage housing/relocation cost within budget (W4699); ensure housing meets…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Manage housing/relocation cost within budget (W4699); ensure housing meets welfare/BFP/OSH standards (VS-144); retain records (VS-88)
Responsible (R): Relocation / Accommodation
Accountable (A): Head of Global Mobility / CFO
