    <bpmn:process id="W_W4720" name="W4720. Mobility Analytics, Cost &amp; ROI Dashboard" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Periodic reporting; assignment-end ROI; leadership review
Frequency: Quarterly + per assignment end
Volume: 1 mobility analytics &amp; ROI dashboard
Owner: Head of Global Mobility / Analytics
Participants: Finance/FP&amp;A (VS-17.4), People Analytics (VS-103), CHRO, CFO, Strategy (VS-33)
Source: workflow W4720 — Mobility Analytics, Cost &amp; ROI Dashboard</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4720_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4720_Lane1" name="Global Mobility">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4720_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4720_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4720_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4720_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4720_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4720_Start3" name="Periodic reporting; assignment-end ROI; leadership review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4720_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4720_Task4" name="Maintain mobility analytics: assignment cost (actual vs. budget W4699)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Maintain mobility analytics: assignment cost (actual vs. budget W4699), cost-per-assignee, localization rate, transfer retention, assignment-success/business-outcome, and KRIs (W4703)
Responsible (R): Global Mobility / Analytics / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): Head of Global Mobility / CHRO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4720_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4720_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4720_Task5" name="Compute assignment ROI (business value delivered vs. total assignment cost) at…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Compute assignment ROI (business value delivered vs. total assignment cost) at assignment end and aggregate; identify cost-optimization and policy improvements (localization W4718, package benchmarking VS-102)
Responsible (R): Global Mobility / Finance / Strategy
Accountable (A): Head of Global Mobility / CHRO / CFO
Duration: Per end + quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4720_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4720_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4720_Task6" name="Report to leadership (CHRO/CFO/Strategy VS-33); feed into workforce planning…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Report to leadership (CHRO/CFO/Strategy VS-33); feed into workforce planning (VS-103) and the make-vs.-buy talent decision (foreign assignee vs. local development VS-123)
Responsible (R): Global Mobility / Strategy / People Analytics
Accountable (A): Head of Global Mobility / CHRO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4720_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4720_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4720_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4720_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-712 (ensure controlled execution — Assignment Administration, Tax/Payroll, Repatriation &amp; Analytics (PA-160.3).) | - CTL-712: outcome-oriented analytics; ROI computed per assignment; reported to leadership; informs talent decisions
Owner: Head of Global Mobility / Analytics</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
